# Local dev environment for InsightForge — NOT committed (see .gitignore).
#
# Single database URL for the whole stack: the FastAPI app (db.py) and
# alembic (database/migrations/env.py) both read DATABASE_URL and nothing else.
#
# Neon PostgreSQL, pooled endpoint. The app and alembic use the asyncpg driver,
# which does not understand libpq's sslmode/channel_binding params — asyncpg
# takes ssl=require instead (SCRAM channel binding is negotiated automatically).
# prepared_statement_cache_size=0 keeps SQLAlchemy off named prepared statements,
# which Neon's PgBouncer (-pooler) endpoint shares across pooled sessions.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://neondb_owner:npg_pdmaHvO76gFY@ep-cold-hill-ayymzzi6-pooler.c-5.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?ssl=require&prepared_statement_cache_size=0

